<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!--
  The community "Tivaan's Familiar Cards" (CBLoader/Custom/36-companion.part)
  give each familiar a fake at-will power card that restates its statistics.
  4ecb prints a familiar card instead (docs/familiar-card-proposal.md), so each
  of those cards becomes an inert Internal record under the same ID: the
  familiar's grant still resolves, and no power card is printed.

  Kept: ID_TIV_FAMILIAR-413-5, the Widow of Arach-Tinilith theme's spider,
  which is not a Familiar element and so gets no familiar card.
-->
